  "description": {
   "value": "<p><strong>Cost:</strong> 500eb (Expensive)<br><strong>Attachment slots:</strong> 0<br><strong>Fits:</strong> All Weapons</p>\n<p>Needs a DV17 Electronics/Security Tech check to attach; one per weapon. Unauthorized users can't use the weapon or its features (firearms also can't be unloaded; melee weapons still work as weapons but their special features don't). Bypassing takes 1 minute and a DV17 Electronics/Security Tech check. On a weapon that already has biometrics, the bypass rises to DV24 and anyone without a valid key who tries to use it is hit as if by a Stun Baton to the body.</p>\n<p><em>From <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/13EnSAoiLDsC7zmL-Jr1RqIh_EnuVuFnExqiipDVquMk/edit\">Corgo's 77 Collection V3</a> by Corgopolis (Weapons &gt; Attachment Catalog &gt; Grips &amp; Controls).</em></p>"
